yebrow\">Follow-up consultations</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Standard follow-up consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-1 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">30 minutes</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£250</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Check-in follow-up consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-1 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">15 minutes</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£125</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"mx-auto mt-14 max-w-[1000px] border-t pt-8 text-center\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">Consultation fees do not include laboratory testing. Blood test costs vary according to the investigations selected and will be discussed at your initial consultation. Further information is available in our <a class=\"text-[color:var(--ink)] underline decoration-[color:var(--bronze)] underline-offset-4\" href=\"/faqs/\">FAQs</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"btn-luxe\" href=\"/book/\">Book an appointment</a></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell tsc-clinic__split-heading\">\n\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Clinical standards</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Regulated, accredited care</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>All care delivered at Harley Street follows the clinic’s established governance, patient-safety standards and clinical protocols.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__accreditations\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-gmc.png\" alt=\"GMC Registered\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>GMC Registered</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-cqc.png\" alt=\"CQC Standards\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>CQC Standards</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-bma.svg\" alt=\"BMA\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>BMA</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-rcgp.avif\" alt=\"RCGP\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>RCGP</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-ifm.png\" alt=\"IFM\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>IFM</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-abhrt.avif\" alt=\"ABHRT\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>ABHRT</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__map\" aria-label=\"Harley Street clinic map\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t<iframe title=\"Map showing The Schoeman Clinic Harley Street\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=96+Harley+Street,+London+W1G+7HY&output=embed\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section tsc-clinic__locations\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell\">\n\t\t<header style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Our other locations</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Wimbledon and virtual consultations across the UK.</h2>\n\t\t</header>\n\t\t<div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 80ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 80ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group flex h-full flex-col border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-background p-8 transition-all duration-700 hover:border-[color:var(--champagne)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--foreground)_6%,transparent)] md:p-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Wimbledon · South West London</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Wimbledon</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<address class=\"mt-6 not-italic text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic<br>4 St Marks Place, Wimbledon<br>London SW19 7NP</address>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-7 text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">A quieter village setting offering the same specialist hormonal, metabolic and longevity care as Harley Street.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-auto pt-10\"><a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe inline-flex w-full\" href=\"/clinic/wimbledon/\">View Wimbledon</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group flex h-full flex-col border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-background p-8 transition-all duration-700 hover:border-[color:var(--champagne)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--foreground)_6%,transparent)] md:p-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Across the United Kingdom</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Virtual appointments</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<address class=\"mt-6 not-italic text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">Secure online consultations<br>Available throughout the UK</address>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-7 text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The same specialist care from wherever you are. Consultations, blood testing, prescriptions and repeat monitoring can all be managed remotely.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-auto pt-10\"><a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe inline-flex w-full\" href=\"/clinic/virtual-appointments/\">Book a virtual appointment</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"border-y bg-background\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 18%, transparent)\">\n\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-28 md:px-12 md:py-36\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__aside\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__sticky\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[0.62rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.34em]\" style=\"color:var(--bronze)\">Frequently asked</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.005em] md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Your questions, <span class=\"italic font-normal\" style=\"color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 60%, transparent)\">answered.</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__prompt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe inline-flex\" href=\"/book/\">Book an appointment</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-accordion=\"\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Do I need a GP referral?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(0)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:1fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">No. You may self-refer directly by phone, email or online enquiry. We recommend keeping your GP informed of any specialist care you receive.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Can I be seen online instead of in person?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Yes. The Schoeman Clinic is a hybrid practice. Initial and follow-up consultations, blood testing, prescriptions and repeat testing can all be managed remotely.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Can I switch between Wimbledon and Harley Street?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Yes. Care is shared seamlessly between our two London clinics, so you can attend whichever location suits you without repeating your history.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Is parking available nearby?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Metered street parking and several public car parks are available near Harley Street. We recommend checking current availability before your appointment.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">What conditions are treated at Harley Street?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Our Harley Street clinic covers the full scope of our work: hormone health, longevity, metabolic and digestive health, plus diagnostics and supportive care.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">How long is an initial consultation?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Initial consultations are generous, allowing time for a full history and discussion of your goals. We will confirm the exact duration when you book.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\t"
}
